@HotelTravel.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5152

### Hotels
GET {{HotelTravel.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels
Accept: application/json

### Login (admin və ya istifadəçi)
POST {{HotelTravel.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123"
}

### Flights
GET {{HotelTravel.API_HostAddress}}/api/flights/search?fromCity=Baku&toCity=Istanbul&date=2026-12-01&passengers=1
Accept: application/json
